  unitName: Lawful Warrior Aneil
  unitId: 30293
  unitNumber: 647
  description: A good friend of Reed's, the soldier who led many civilians to El
    Gaia during the last stages of the war with the gods. He made plans to head for
    El Gaia to help his childhood friends, Reed & Lucana. It is said that while he
    had a genius-like ability for magic paired with an amazing intellect, he was
    never able to realise his true potential due to his cowardly personality. However,
    while protecting the refugees from the god army's attacks, he started having
    a change of heart, and meeting a certain person gave his powers the chance to
    bloom.
  summonDesc: W-What's going on all of a sudden?!<br>D-Do you really think I'm good
    enough for this...?
  fusionDesc: There's no point in using Fusion<br>on such a weakling like me...
